.title  The first cube
.what   Eight corners measured from the cube's own centre and twelve pairs saying which to join - a model is a list of vectors and a list of joins, and moving it is transforming the vectors
.tier   LESSON
.main   CUBE.ASM
.needs  DRAW14.INC SINTAB.INC
.reads  INFOGR.PAS
.build  FASM CUBE.ASM CUBE.COM
.run    CUBE.COM
.uses   XLATB IMUL SAR CBW MUL JCXZ LOOP INT
.ignore MAKEINFO.BAT
